               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10;mso-tab-count:1;"> </span>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">3, mind. 200 kg/m2 </span>
              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;line-height:13pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;tab-stops:6.90mm 49.90mm 56.90mm 76.90mm 83.90mm;">
